#: templates/environment-overview-page.php:35
msgid ""
"Records the server-side response times of opening the editor, saving, "
"autosaving and media uploads for posts and pages, each with the information "
"whether a background analysis was running at the same time, the PHP-FPM pool "
"state and the number of running database threads. Sampling ends "
"automatically after the selected period. The download contains all values of "
"this page as JSON."
